@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

title Plataforma tipo Twitter – Arquitectura High Level

' ====== External Client ======
RECTANGLE Client {
  REST API Calls
}

' ====== Gateway Service ======
RECTANGLE GatewayService {
  - Orquestador
  - Produce Kafka Events
  - Consume Kafka (opcional)
}

' ====== Microservices ======
RECTANGLE AuthService {
  - Validación de usuarios
  - PostgreSQL
}

RECTANGLE UserService {
  - Manejo de relaciones (follow/unfollow)
  - Produce/Consume Kafka
  - PostgreSQL
}

RECTANGLE TweetService {
  - Manejo de tweets
  - Fan-out on write
  - Cache timelines (Redis)
  - PostgreSQL
}

' ====== Message Broker ======
RECTANGLE Kafka {
  - Topic: tweets.published
  - Topic: follows.created
  - Topic: follows.deleted
  - Topic: timelines.update
}

' ====== Databases ======
RECTANGLE PostgreSQLAuth
RECTANGLE PostgreSQLUser
RECTANGLE PostgreSQLTweet

RECTANGLE Redis {
  - Cache de timelines
}

' ====== Connections ======
Client --> GatewayService : REST Calls
GatewayService --> Kafka : Produce events
AuthService --> Kafka : Consume/Produce
UserService --> Kafka : Consume/Produce
TweetService --> Kafka : Consume/Produce

AuthService --> PostgreSQLAuth
UserService --> PostgreSQLUser
TweetService --> PostgreSQLTweet
TweetService --> Redis : Cache timelines
@enduml
